= A New Year: 2020

After 8 years of *"procés"*, a decade of turmoil and political rollercoaster has come to an end. Now, new challenges arise: the looming threat of climate change, the continued political dissatisfaction, the undeniable rise of the far-right in Western countries... and to top it all, a new highly contagious virus seems to have put China in extreme alert. 

In any case, these are stories for another time.

- @game_over: End Game